<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hannezo, Prost & Joanny (2014) PNAS & Krajnc & Ziherl (2015) PRE 3D epithelial sheet morphology (squamous-to-cuboidal-to-columnar scaling & apico-basal buckling) — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
