<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hannezo, Prost & Joanny (2014) PNAS & Krajnc & Ziherl (2015) PRE 3D epithelial sheet morphology (squamous-to-cuboidal-to-columnar scaling & apico-basal buckling) — Model fidelity to source: 58/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes equilibrium cell height h_0, width d_0, aspect ratio h_0/d_0 = c*Gamma_l/[4*(Gamma_a+Gamma_b)], bending modulus kappa_eff, spontaneous curvature C_0, and buckling wavelength lambda_c = 2*pi*(kappa_eff/K_sub)^(1/4) (L46-72), backed by 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_047_epithelial_buckling_3d.lean`. However, `generate_cosine_buckled_profile` (L74-82) uses a closed-form cosine ansatz instead of minimizing the coupled 3D epithelial + substrate energy functional, and omits the 5-regime (Gamma_l/Gamma_a, K_sub) phase diagram." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py L74–L82: Closed-form 1D cosine buckling ansatz rather than L-BFGS-B energy minimization <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py#L74-L82>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hannezo, Prost & Joanny (2014) PNAS & Krajnc & Ziherl (2015) PRE 3D epithelial sheet morphology (squamous-to-cuboidal-to-columnar scaling & apico-basal buckling) — Morphometric validation: 53/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L175-207) reports only 3 analytic aspect-ratio values without cross-species Pearson r, p-value, RMSE, log-log scaling slope, without L-BFGS-B buckled wavelength/curvature metrics, without E-cadherin/Myosin-II perturbation deltas, and without specimen CV morphometrics." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py L175–L207: Only 3 basic aspect-ratio metrics without statistical tests or specimen segmentation <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py#L175-L207>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-measurement-mouse-alveolar-squamous-aspect-ratio-h0-d0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-measurement-mouse-renal-collecting-duct-cuboidal-aspect-ratio-h0-d0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-measurement-mouse-small-intestine-tall-columnar-aspect-ratio-h0-d0> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hannezo, Prost & Joanny (2014) PNAS & Krajnc & Ziherl (2015) PRE 3D epithelial sheet morphology (squamous-to-cuboidal-to-columnar scaling & apico-basal buckling) — MorphoEval overall 53.6/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py` (overall weighted score: 56.4/100). The v1 script implements the Hannezo-Prost-Joanny (2014) 3D incompressible single-cell energy E_cell(A) = (Gamma_a + Gamma_b)*A + c*Gamma_l*V_0/(2*sqrt(A)), equilibrium height h_0, aspect ratio h_0/d_0, and critical buckling wavelength lambda_c = 2*pi*(kappa_eff/K_sub)^(1/4), backed by 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_047_epithelial_buckling_3d.lean`, but relies on a closed-form cosine buckling ansatz instead of L-BFGS-B energy minimization, omits the full 2D (Gamma_l/Gamma_a, K_sub) 5-regime phase diagram and Drosophila comparative tissues, omits E-cadherin knockdown and Myosin-II hyperactivation perturbations, and does not segment the vendored histology specimen (`epithelial_sheet_buckling_specimen.jpg`). Overall 53.6/100 (faithfulness 47.4, reproducibility 67.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 49, Morphometric validation 53, Source and data traceability 75, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/epithelial_buckling_3d_comparison.png: rendered output of 2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py at e93f00e, image/png, 167647 B, 1458×1117 px, artifact_sha256 e5d0e99cc20e4a6ec380a3c440718ab585c303f5100c768bb0fa174f07c45161 (sha256 e5d0e99cc20e4a6ec380a3c440718ab585c303f5100c768bb0fa174f07c45161), spec_fingerprint eabe5855ceb1bf4a12fea7ec7b30902813b84c0440d83d21ca21bb917876b36c. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: eabe5855ceb1bf4a12fea7ec7b30902813b84c0440d83d21ca21bb917876b36c; artifact_sha256: e5d0e99cc20e4a6ec380a3c440718ab585c303f5100c768bb0fa174f07c45161; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/epithelial_buckling_3d_reference.json=eef9f75ed38ce872..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/epithelial_sheet_buckling_specimen.jpg=cd05cc85a7f49dd2..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/paper_citations.bib=e4556865f1879134..., datasets/epithelial_buckling_3d/scout_manifest.json=99741cb299962b18...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Evaluate all 12 comparative epithelial tissues across Mus musculus and Drosophila melanogaster with Pearson r, p-value, RMSE, and log-log scaling exponent.",
        "remediation needed: Implement all 5 genetic/mechanical perturbation controls: wild-type buckled columnar folds, E-cadherin knockdown flattening (Gamma_l/Gamma_a depleted -> flat squamous), apical Myosin-II hyperactivation (Gamma_a >> Gamma_b -> apical constriction folding), basal tension hyperactivation (Gamma_b >> Gamma_a -> spontaneous curvature sign reversal), and soft-substrate spherical acinus closure.",
        "remediation needed: Replace the closed-form cosine buckling ansatz with a coupled 3D epithelial cell + substrate bending energy minimizer (L-BFGS-B) across the full 2D phase diagram in (Gamma_l / Gamma_a, K_sub) spanning flat squamous, cuboidal, columnar, buckled folds, and spherical acini.",
        "remediation needed: Segment the vendored CC0 histology micrograph (`epithelial_sheet_buckling_specimen.jpg`) to measure epithelial monolayer height h_0, lateral cell width d_0, aspect ratio h_0/d_0, and fold wavelength lambda_c, and enforce runtime SHA-256 verification." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.36e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hannezo, Prost & Joanny (2014) PNAS & Krajnc & Ziherl (2015) PRE 3D epithelial sheet morphology (squamous-to-cuboidal-to-columnar scaling & apico-basal buckling) — Parameter expressivity: 49/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates 8 mouse epithelial rows across squamous, cuboidal, and columnar regimes (L85-107), but omits the 4 Drosophila melanogaster comparative rows, omits the 2D (Gamma_l/Gamma_a, K_sub) phase diagram across all 5 regimes, omits the 5 genetic/pharmacological perturbations (E-cadherin knockdown, apical Myosin-II hyperactivation, basal tension inversion, soft-substrate acini), and exposes no CLI parameter overrides." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py L85–L107: Single-species subset without perturbation controls, 2D phase diagram, or CLI overrides <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2016-hannezo-epithelial-buckling-3d.py#L85-L107>" ;
    pk:hasScore 4.9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

